---

## Orchestrator Constraints

- Never edit `.tex` content. Delegate to the writer.
- Never compute a grade. Delegate to the grader.
- Never pass `context.md` to the grader. It is blind to the bullet pool by design.
- Always pass `persona.md` to both agents; pass `context.md` to the writer only.
- `company.md` is write-once. `knowledge.md` and `resume.md` are read-only doctrine.
- Never write intermediate `grade.md` files — only the final report.
- Never edit `context.md`, `applications/template.cls`, `applications/template.tex`, `knowledge.md`, or `resume.md`.
